This dip-buying spree—now looking back, it feels pretty damn good 😂

UNI bought at $2.98, currently up 96%;
HYPE bought at $65, currently about 30% profit;
AAVE bought at $84, currently up 51%;
ETH positioned at $1556, currently up 66%;
SOL bought at $65, currently up 60%.

When the market is panicking, nobody dares to buy. Once it starts pumping, everyone starts asking whether they can still chase.

So the real comfortable profits were never made by chasing after the price goes up—they’re patiently squeezed out at the bottom, a little at a time.

This time, a few community picks laid out at the bottom really did deliver. 🍊

$UNI #ETH $SOL

